---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Cost Breakdown Transparency: Managing ROI in High-Volume Manufacturing"
  description="A guide to understanding the unit costs of activewear manufacturing. Learn how transparency and volume optimize your procurement budget."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Financial Strategy</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Transparency in Pricing: <span class="text-accent italic">Cost Breakdown Strategies</span></h1>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 20, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>12 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">A $0.50 difference in unit price can shift your profit margin by $15,000 on a 30,000-piece order. At Fitclo, we believe in radical transparency.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. The "Hidden" Costs of Cheap Manufacturing</h2>
      <p>Low-ball quotes often hide costs that surface later: high defect rates, inconsistent sizing, and poor fabric durability. Our pricing is inclusive of **100% garment inspection (FQC)** and premium export packaging, ensuring your "landed cost" is accurate and free of hidden surprises.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Volume Discount Tiers</h2>
      <p>As your volume increases, our fixed costs (R&D, setup, pattern making) are amortized over more units. We pass these savings directly to you. For clients exceeding $30k per month, we provide a **Total Cost of Ownership (TCO)** breakdown that accounts for logistics, branding, and manufacturing efficiency.</p>

      <div class="bg-accent/10 p-12 rounded-[40px] my-12">
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-black text-black mb-6 uppercase">Cost Drivers Analysis:</h4>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div>
            <span class="block font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase text-xs mb-2">Raw Material</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-black">45-55%</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase text-xs mb-2">Labor & Craft</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-black">25-30%</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase text-xs mb-2">QC & Overhead</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-black">15-20%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Long-Term Price Locks</h2>
      <p>Raw material prices (especially premium Lycra and Spandex) fluctuate. For our high-volume B2B partners, we offer **Quarterly Price Locks**. By forecasting your demand 6 months in advance, we pre-purchase raw materials to hedge against inflation, keeping your margins stable and predictable.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Analyze Your Unit Costs</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Connect with our finance team for a detailed margin analysis and volume pricing quote.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Get Margin Analysis</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
